"By law a new superhuman must register once given a class."
"Registered superhumans must live on Anesidora or in another hero zone."
"Supervillains typically refuse to register."
"A class can be registered at the desk of an Artonan consulate."
"Not registering makes an Avowed a criminal everywhere on Earth."
"A small but real number of unregistered Avowed live normal lives apart from summons."
"Popular belief holds that not registering is step one to becoming a supervillain."
"Registration happens only after affixation."
"At a ceremony the Avowed, with family and sometimes news crews, declares intent to register."
"Gorgon congratulates them, files paperwork with the US or Canada, shakes hands and gives a pen."
"Registration moves the Avowed's citizenship to Anesidora Island automatically."
